cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "ipa_verbatim"
abstract: >-
  A Python tool for IPA (International Phonetic Alphabet) verbatim
  transcription: aligns speech audio to IPA phonemes using the
  facebook/wav2vec2-xlsr-53-espeak-cv-ft model and derives a
  rule-based syllables tier from the resulting phoneme alignment.
authors:
